        "action_date": "2025-09-16",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Alan Reinstein Ban Asbestos Now Act of 2025</strong></p><p>This bill generally prohibits the manufacture, process, use, and distribution in commerce of commercial asbestos or any mixture or article containing commercial asbestos. The President may, on application, grant exemptions from the prohibition in situations where it is necessary to protect national security interests.</p>",
